    findings: ["Four signature subtypes: age-related, double-strand break repair, mismatch repair, signature 8.", "45% of double-strand break repair cases had no BRCA1, BRCA2 or PALB2 event.", "Repair-defective subtypes express more cytotoxic and checkpoint genes with more neoantigens."],
